From: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: pcs: qcom-ipq9574: add external PHY refclk

UNIPHY can supply a 25/50MHz reference clock to an external Ethernet
PHY. Add a clock ID for that output so consumers can express the
dependency through the common clock framework.

Signed-off-by: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
--- a/include/dt-bindings/net/qcom,ipq9574-pcs.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/net/qcom,ipq9574-pcs.h
@@ -12,4 +12,7 @@
 #define PCS_RX_CLK		0
 #define PCS_TX_CLK		1
 
+/* Reference clock output from UNIPHY to an external Ethernet PHY. */
+#define PCS_PHY_REF_CLK		2
+
 #endif /* _DT_BINDINGS_PCS_QCOM_IPQ9574_H */
